<title>UK: Taiwan Liton details $60 mln convertible.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Liton details $60 mln convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indicated terms of the following bond were announced by lead manager Bankers Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TAIWAN LITON ELECTRONICS CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT  *$60 MLN	  COUPON  ** 0.5-1.0   MATURITY	.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   DENOMS (K) ONE	 IND PREM  ** 8-14 PCT</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/TW/HK/SI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES    **INDICATED TERMS. PRICING AND ALLOCATION ON 19.JUN.97</p>
<p>		ROADSHOWS END 19.JUN.97</p>
<p>		CONVERTIBLE FROM AUG.97 TO MAY.04</p>
<p>		CALLABLE FROM YEAR THREE SUBJECT TO 140 PCT RULE</p>
<p>		PUT OPTION YEAR FIVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
